# Cleaned up from assimp's FBX->OBJ export.
# The original FBX has no embedded textures (confirmed via `assimp info`),
# and the exported map_Kd/map_Ns/bump paths point at files that don't
# exist in this project (and contain a space, which would break this
# project's fscanf("%s", ...) token parser). Replaced with a solid
# wood-brown color instead of a texture.

newmtl Material
Ka 0.150000 0.100000 0.060000
Kd 0.450000 0.320000 0.180000
Ks 0.050000 0.050000 0.050000
Ke 0.000000 0.000000 0.000000
Ns 8.000000
d 1.000000
